  "steps": [
    "Select PC-A, turn on Traceroute in the action bar, write 10.3.0.10, press Trace, then Run.",
    "The first request has TTL 1: R1 discards it and sends back a Time Exceeded. Watch it in the timeline.",
    "Each next request lives one hop longer, until PC-C itself answers with an Echo Reply.",
    "Count the hops, read the TTL of PC-C's reply in the Frame tab, write both answers and press Check."
  ],
  "hints": [
    "Every router a datagram crosses lowers its TTL by one.",
